<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mohd Saad Siddiqui - Portfolio</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a, #1e293b);
            color: #f8fafc;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        section {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        }
        h1, h2, h3 {
            color: #38bdf8;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #38bdf8;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        .photo-frame {
            background: #1e293b;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 2px solid #38bdf8;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 15px 0;
            max-width: 100%;
        }
        .photo-frame img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 400px;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: block;
        }
        a {
            color: #38bdf8;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        a:hover {
            color: #7dd3fc;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <section>
            <h1>Mohd Saad Siddiqui</h1>
            <p>Welcome to my professional portfolio showcasing my projects, internships, and achievements.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="projects">
            <h2>Featured Projects</h2>
            <p>Project report cover supplied as “Online Coffee Shop”; the report body identifies the work as “Amazon Website Clone Using HTML & CSS.”</p>
            <div class="photo-frame">
                <img src="project.jpg" alt="Project Image">
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="resume">
            <h2>Certificates & Evidence</h2>

            <h3>Web Development Internship</h3>
            <p>NextGen Coding Infotech • 45 days • Outstanding</p>
            <div class="photo-frame">
                <img src="internship.jpg" alt="Internship Certificate">
            </div>

            <h3>Full Stack Development</h3>
            <p>Varcas Software Solution • .NET Technologies</p>
            <div class="photo-frame">
                <img src="fullstack.jpg" alt="Full Stack Certificate">
            </div>

            <h3>Amazon Website Summer Training</h3>
            <p>Integral University • 2025–2026</p>
            <div class="photo-frame">
                <img src="training.jpg" alt="Training Certificate">
            </div>

            <h3>Diploma Statement of Marks</h3>
            <p>Integral University • First Division with Honours</p>
            <div class="photo-frame">
                <img src="marksheet.jpg" alt="Diploma Marksheet">
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
